    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception: G1 models motion commands, G2 models sensor outcomes.",
    "Specification E1 encodes the exploration policy: random_walk in clear, move_forward for progress, deterministic turn recovery on obstacles, and full_rotate only as last resort."
